    "created_at": "2020-12-20T16:16:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-12-20T16:16:46Z",
    "body": "After looking into this issue further, I've found a simple solution for `nvs` specifically. `nvs` replaces the prompt function with its own, but also executes the original, so every time starship loads, it removes `nvs`. By adding `nvs auto on` after `Invoke-Expression (&starship init powershell)` in my profile, I am able to make it work successfully.",
